    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/ecd90031045cd0dcfafe28b295086cbe.avif?t=1755686693\" data-has-big width=800 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I switched on my microphone and let the quiet settle in before asking the first question:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cHow did you die?\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/4b8ffe3ed92ae330a7a0d42f0ed08a15.poster.avif?t=1755686693\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/4b8ffe3ed92ae330a7a0d42f0ed08a15.webm?t=1755686693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/4b8ffe3ed92ae330a7a0d42f0ed08a15.mp4?t=1755686693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/195fea0e19e264e4f8fe7b1c1eaff772.avif?t=1755686693\" data-has-big width=800 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019ve returned to the mansion after years, haunted by old memories. It\u2019s been shut down since the incident. I turn on my camcorder and step inside to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/ca27d57b8e5397fdfb2e8e47404a8a3d.avif?t=1755686693\" data-has-big width=800 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m determined to uncover every hidden detail, documenting the entire process for the world to witness in my camcorder.  No bookcase, painting, or door will go unchecked\u2014every corner holds a secret waiting to be revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/d2e384b31ca51dc862f706371319963a.poster.avif?t=1755686693\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/d2e384b31ca51dc862f706371319963a.webm?t=1755686693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/d2e384b31ca51dc862f706371319963a.mp4?t=1755686693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/7830553da02bae43aa1c38d2a358ab91.avif?t=1755686693\" data-has-big width=800 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I searched around the house to find clues of my family's tragedy. I found newspaper articles that never saw the light of day and someone's notes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/4de25a35d392c8883081ef55c55fa4b3.poster.avif?t=1755686693\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/4de25a35d392c8883081ef55c55fa4b3.webm?t=1755686693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/4de25a35d392c8883081ef55c55fa4b3.mp4?t=1755686693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/475c4fb47311147669a963ac4ea4f802.avif?t=1755686693\" data-has-big width=800 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/704ad0d9171a1af8ee8cd919dcbcfebd.poster.avif?t=1755686693\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/704ad0d9171a1af8ee8cd919dcbcfebd.webm?t=1755686693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/704ad0d9171a1af8ee8cd919dcbcfebd.mp4?t=1755686693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/da87c09042f67bce70aa84073d7a08ea.avif?t=1755686693\" data-has-big width=800 height=56 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First Person horror game exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice Recognition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the story through Note Collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve Puzzles &amp; Riddles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/ecd90031045cd0dcfafe28b295086cbe.avif?t=1755686693\" data-has-big width=800 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I switched on my microphone and let the quiet settle in before asking the first question:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cHow did you die?\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/4b8ffe3ed92ae330a7a0d42f0ed08a15.poster.avif?t=1755686693\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/4b8ffe3ed92ae330a7a0d42f0ed08a15.webm?t=1755686693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/4b8ffe3ed92ae330a7a0d42f0ed08a15.mp4?t=1755686693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/195fea0e19e264e4f8fe7b1c1eaff772.avif?t=1755686693\" data-has-big width=800 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019ve returned to the mansion after years, haunted by old memories. It\u2019s been shut down since the incident. I turn on my camcorder and step inside to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/ca27d57b8e5397fdfb2e8e47404a8a3d.avif?t=1755686693\" data-has-big width=800 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >