pe=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/475c4fb47311147669a963ac4ea4f802.avif?t=1755686693\" data-has-big width=800 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/704ad0d9171a1af8ee8cd919dcbcfebd.poster.avif?t=1755686693\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/704ad0d9171a1af8ee8cd919dcbcfebd.webm?t=1755686693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/704ad0d9171a1af8ee8cd919dcbcfebd.mp4?t=1755686693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/da87c09042f67bce70aa84073d7a08ea.avif?t=1755686693\" data-has-big width=800 height=56 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First Person horror game exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice Recognition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the story through Note Collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve Puzzles &amp; Riddles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
